  "details": "The order of images displayed in the \"Your Uploaded Photos\" from \"Select an Image\" (group post creation) and \"Upload Thumbnail\" (event creation) are not consistent with each other. Currently, adding an image to an event displays your uploaded photos newest to oldest, whereas adding an image to a group post displays your uploaded photos oldest to newest. It would be nice to have these be consistent with each other (with my slight preference being displaying both as newest to oldest).",
